  "statement": {
    "representation": "markdown-latex",
    "text": "Let $m_1\\leq\\cdots\\leq m_k$ and $n$ be sufficiently large. If $T$ is a tree on $n$ vertices and $G$ is the complete multipartite graph with vertex class sizes $m_1,\\ldots,m_k$ then prove that $ R(T,G)\\leq (\\chi(G)-1)(R(T,K_{m_1,m_2})-1)+m_1. $ ",
